cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CoLA-MVFC: reference implementation of collaborative label-anchored semi-supervised multi-view fuzzy clustering"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying paper listed under preferred-citation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Xuan Hoang
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0007-1721-6931
    affiliation: Hanoi University of Industry, Hanoi, Vietnam
  - family-names: Mai
    given-names: Dinh Sinh
    affiliation: Le Quy Don Technical University, Hanoi, Vietnam
  - family-names: Nguyen
    given-names: Long Giang
    affiliation: Institute of Information Technology, Vietnam Academy of Science and Technology, Hanoi, Vietnam
abstract: >-
  NumPy reference implementation of CoLA-MVFC, a collaborative semi-supervised
  multi-view fuzzy clustering model in which every quantity a view contributes
  (per-dimension metric, class means, classifier guidance cost, view weight) is
  estimated from the fixed label set and expressed in a unit defined on it, and
  the views collaborate through one shared fuzzy membership. Includes the
  label-sampling and block-corruption functions used in the paper, a
  synthetic demonstration and tests.
keywords:
  - fuzzy c-means
  - semi-supervised clustering
  - multi-view clustering
  - collaborative clustering
  - hyperspectral
  - remote sensing
license: MIT
